  m_text: "<b><color=#EDCC8C>Game and code</color></b>\n\nEndasil \nI stated this
    project after watching a live stream unity haunted house tutoral 2025.  I created
    it in VRChat as a first step to learning U# as a C# programmer.\n\n<b><color=#EDCC8C>Art,
    models and sound effects</color></b>\nJohn Lemon's Haunted Jaunt\nby Unity Technologies\n\n<b><color=#EDCC8C>Music</color></b>\nMors
    Aeterna by Blaise Douros (2004)\nMade for another of my game projects.\n\n<b><color=#EDCC8C>Snowball
    assets</color></b>\nLance Wusky\n\n<b><color=#EDCC8C>Other</color></b>\nThanks
    to Lance Wusky for teaching me \nhow to use script to fade in the fog.\nSmartObjectSync
    by MMMaellon"
